'''Merzin Keysax''' was a [[human]] who served as a [[lieutenant]] in the [[Galactic Empire]]. Following the [[Ambush on Ferrix|Ferrix incident]], an [[Imperial Military]] force was deployed under the command of [[Captain]] [[Vanis Tigo]]. After [[ISB Supervisor]] [[Lieutenant]] [[Dedra Meero]] gained control of the [[Free Trade sector|Morlana sector]] from Supervisor [[Blevin]], Keysax helped chase down [[Bix Caleen]], a person of interest to the Empire.<ref name="Narkina 5" /> Keysax participated in defending Imperial interests during the [[Ferrix Riot|riot on Rix Road]].<ref name="Rix Road" />

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Merzin Keysax first appeared in "[[Narkina 5 (episode)|Narkina 5]]," the eighth episode of the [[Andor Season 1|first season]] of the live-action series ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]'', where the lieutenant was portrayed by [[Nick Moss]].<ref name="Narkina 5" /> They were first identified as Keysax in a since-deleted image asset release on Getty Images by [[The Walt Disney Company|Walt Disney Studios]] on [[August 1]].<ref name="Getty">{{Getty|url=thewaltdisneystudios/allaccess/#!asset/6vx5pwtjxz9w5wjk2f2zjkxf|text=Andor Promo Asset|author=[[The Walt Disney Company|The Walt Disney Studios]]|date=2022-08-01|nobackup=1}}</ref>

